The colostomy subgroup was not analyzed separately, as it included only 2 studies. Heterogeneity remained high within each subgroup (I² = 87.4% and 87.3%). Pooled estimates and prediction intervals were similar between subgroups. The test for subgroup difference was not significant (p = 0.878).

